{"ID":"20240515131414-3mjh9ds","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131414-3mjh9ds","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131414-3mjh9ds\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140510-irp5l4u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140510-irp5l4u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140510-irp5l4u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:439,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:439\u0026#125;","title":"058","type":"doc","updated":"20240515162303"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140510-irp5l4u","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 821px;","id":"20240515140510-irp5l4u","updated":"20240515162303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：２００８／０４／１７"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LA"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３０歲，細小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/06"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因： 月經曾不規則，服5/19方後已規則。三月來已正常，今來覆診，並欲再產子。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.月事如何：近三月都每月一行。下次月經將於下週來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.怕冷嗎：較不怕冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.睡眠：睡不好。(因5/19方有麻黃)→此女月經以正常代表心臟有好轉但他睡眠不好故知心臟仍還不是很好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.白天還想睡嗎：減少了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.運動有汗嗎：有。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.還有盜汗嗎：已減少。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.大便：每日行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.小便：淡黃色。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.口渴嗎：有一點。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.喜熱飲冷飲：喜室溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩、細小"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手掌一直都乾，冬季則脫皮，按三陰交則無壓痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡紅舌，有齒痕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 : "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區圈紋且有破洞"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"裡寒、血虛"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方：  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝三錢 白芍三錢 炙甘草二錢 大棗十枚 當歸三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木通二錢細辛二錢 熟地二錢 川芎三錢 柴胡三錢 玉金五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸棗仁三錢丹皮三錢 麥冬三錢   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20帖   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9 碗水煮成3碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用當歸四逆湯補虛去寒，因他大便每天有，故木通輕用。因下焦有實，心熱逆行到手致乾 。因多用陽藥，故必生男。如要產雙胞胎，須用風水改建廚房於東與東南之間。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註：２０付"}]}]}]}]}